WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:03.019
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.843
What do they see?

3
00:00:05.844 --> 00:00:08.676
They see a candy shop.

4
00:00:08.677 --> 00:00:16.061
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:16.062 --> 00:00:35.724
They eat crunchy candy.

6
00:00:35.725 --> 00:01:08.520
They eat colorful candy.

7
00:01:08.521 --> 00:01:20.283
They eat sour candy.

8
00:01:20.284 --> 00:01:38.144
They eat chewy candy.

9
00:01:38.145 --> 00:01:59.365
They eat hard candy.

10
00:01:59.366 --> 00:02:11.388
They eat fluffy candy.

11
00:02:11.389 --> 00:02:18.070
They eat too much candy.

12
00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:26.150
Blobs, calm down!

13
00:02:26.151 --> 00:02:29.166
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:29.167 --> 00:02:31.931
Good-bye!

